  "objectives": [
    "Identify the structural components of DNA and how they assemble into a double helix.",
    "Apply complementary base-pairing rules and understand hydrogen bond differences.",
    "Understand antiparallel directionality (5' to 3') and how it necessitates leading and lagging strands during replication.",
    "Identify the main enzymes in replication (helicase, DNA polymerase, ligase) and their specific roles at the replication fork.",
    "Explain the semiconservative nature of DNA replication."
