          "changeMeaning": "Show the complete DNA double helix rotating to highlight the sugar-phosphate backbone and overall spiral structure",
          "narration": "Welcome to the molecular world. Before you is the DNA double helix. Notice the two continuous outer ribbons; these are the sugar-phosphate backbones, spiraling around a common axis in a right-handed helix."
        },
